{"id":"ac33b0fe891fc14f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-logic.md","title":"Modal Logic","display":"df-modal-logic — Modal Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-logic","aliases":["89-df-modal-logic"],"display":"df-modal-logic — Modal Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-logic — Modal Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\Box}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\nL_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\Box}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\nL_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\Box}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">